{
  "openrpc": "1.3.2",
  "info": {
    "title": "ae/tournament",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "A tournament of rounds: entries, rebuy offers, eliminations, finishing places and the winner. Pure: every member takes a state and returns a new one. Chips live in an injected chip ledger, levels in an injected level schedule, the people and computers in a seating. Times given to it (actionMs) are milliseconds on the table's action clock. Server: TypeScript `implementation/server/tournament.ts`, `implementation/server/migrate.ts` (exportAll, importAll). Build once with createTournament(settings, {ledger, schedule, seating}); methods named `Tournament.<name>` are members of the object it returns. Client standings rows: TypeScript `implementation/web/results.ts`, Swift `implementation/apple/Sources/ResultRows.swift`, Kotlin `ae.tournament` `ResultRows.kt` (resultRows, headingKey)."
  },
